cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Training-Free Long-Context Inference at a 2B-Quantized Mobile Memory Operating Point"
message: If you use these evaluation results, please cite this paper.
type: article
authors:
  - name: Fusion Aperture
date-released: "2026-08-19"
abstract: >-
  Locked evaluation of Fusion Aperture on a frozen Qwen3.5-2B Q4_K_M host
  with no extra long-context training. RULER, a 110-cell NIAH ladder, and
  OpenAI-MRCR are reported together with Darwin physical footprint. The
  stack is not described.
keywords:
  - long context
  - on-device inference
  - RULER
  - NIAH
  - MRCR
license: CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0
